{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_synopsis", "source_sha256": "464b9e9b87343756bad889e307a2c67fa9012ab440bf3797eeceffb1268f0b04", "ja": "どこか元気のない響。出演した沖縄フェア\nでの出来事から、今回、目指していたことを\n実現するのは難しいかもと、悩んでしまった\nらしい。だが、みんなの言葉で自信を取り\n戻し、響は改めて自分の目標を宣言した。", "zh": "响看起来有些无精打采。原来是因为\n参加冲绳物产展时发生的事，让她烦恼起\n这次的目标或许很难实现。但在大家的鼓励下\n响找回了自信，再次宣告了自己的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c387b0fea67ed50714a7c8a0805f555cea40abafa5c989ab840e4e0a68185464", "ja": "沖縄フェア　ミニライブ翌日……", "zh": "冲绳主题活动　迷你演唱会翌日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "36547cea06742fdbca66ce086b10b291ba4b61b9ff23ba41ecbd9e83e4e11223", "ja": "響ちゃん、どうしちゃったんだろう……。", "zh": "响到底怎么了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "0eee43c80e9001b13a9d0e20e5206235073f9c582491f2c5033ede3c5bc6e7ce", "ja": "昨日、沖縄フェアのミニライブが終わってから、\nずっとあんな感じだヨ～。何かあったのかな？", "zh": "昨天，冲绳集市的小型演唱会结束之后，\n她就一直是那个样子哟～。是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "ecc9e9524ce8e6247a7fb5bf3f79e80dabcf9fa442af74eb0d7cc4c228af5432", "ja": "やっぱり、お疲れなんでしょうか？　……けど、\nいつも明るい響ちゃんの憂い顔……実に……！", "zh": "果然是因为累了吗？……不过，\n平时总是开朗的响露出忧郁的神情……真是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "c092d9fc9cb38fc961884ef9d29e5414176b064a3ecefdc53780268e19875c4d", "ja": "亜利沙は、変なところでよろこんでないの！\nでも、ホント心配だね。アタシ、聞いてみようか？", "zh": "亚利沙别在这种奇怪的地方高兴起来啊！\n不过，真的很让人担心呢。要不我去问问看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1006_p", "source_sha256": "05894cf5a56bd75ba7127085fa55edf804add69cc7cdb20a404dd5dc331149eb", "ja": "あっ……待ってくれ、みんな。\nその……。", "zh": "啊……等等，大家。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee92e7addbcc00db918deca468adf0060d06015550ffef4f941161a747109937", "ja": "え？　{$P$}、\nもしかして何か知ってるの？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，难道你知道些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5c033a3caa2c9486fc6b66225f00de2ce60f8e3a7c08e5f0fe6a60aae7597a86", "ja": "ああ。けど、話していいのかどうか、\n響に聞いてみてから……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，还是先问问响，看看能不能说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "cfe774fe426b11c81af6fd569a436031d31869c2e56106ee868e5cdfd52ab871", "ja": "{$P$}。\nだったら、自分が話すぞ。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n那样的话，就由我来说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "753f3802dd66e82216fa1ac1e2b4a1429320a27299c7349f064c5eae51a27f50", "ja": "あっ、響ちゃん！\nごめんね、私たち……。", "zh": "啊，响！\n对不起哦，我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "debab86161449ceae14967ea9a8b21c35d59afc28249023783758ab918368563", "ja": "ううん。自分のほうこそ、みんなに\n心配かけちゃったみたいで、ごめんね！", "zh": "不是的。反倒是我，好像让大家担心了，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "28e9053620ae7564ed29816ef1994d41b96dd58a2ad36c4b84c706092d791ff5", "ja": "あの……響ちゃん。\n何があったのか、聞いてもいい……？", "zh": "那个……响。\n能告诉我……发生什么事了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "5ff55bbc4531406495550a0fe1a4539d584c02fd064420918091f4867e598427", "ja": "うん。えっと、\n話すと、ちょっと長くなるんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。那个，\n说起来会有点长就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1014_null", "source_sha256": "af3a72fb078e43b3641f8f767f72a66daa21a309b8b3bdae83c3b0e52c44d034", "ja": "1週間前、沖縄フェア会場……", "zh": "1周前，冲绳物产展会场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2894b2727110b51f4a734684157b601a431a16dfd5aa4d59b8e3567fe314b935", "ja": "というわけで、今日はみんなにこのショッピング\nモール内で、いろいろ食べ歩きしてもらう！", "zh": "所以，今天要让大家在这个购物中心里边逛边吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "64dc195120d2413b1729a8bccaeb1aac58797351b99250f41667a72781b9c6ce", "ja": "今日の撮影って、ワタシ達が「フェア楽し～い！」\nって遊んでるところを、写してもらうんだよネ？", "zh": "今天的拍摄，就是要把我们在商场里边玩边吃、说着“逛美食节好开心！”的样子拍下来，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1017_p", "source_sha256": "199ac34ec8df14e9c748470a80d530d77ec4da8e54064c9a11970537bb87631e", "ja": "ああ。メインはもちろん響だけど、劇場のみんなと\n一緒にいる楽しそうなところを、使いたいそうだ。", "zh": "嗯。主角当然是响，不过听说他们想用她和剧场大家在一起、看起来很开心的画面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "a4d8b4a5a23a9dde723338c6340a3c814ed50516fd08196b3afa4ab9eaf7c480", "ja": "よーしっ！　みんなが沖縄に遊びに行った\n気持ちになれるように、目いっぱい楽しむさー！", "zh": "好——！为了让大家都能有去冲绳游玩的感觉，我要尽情享受啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1019_p", "source_sha256": "696e5b93f9b831c37f450178e455cdf495a2ebb1a6e26c41fd1618f7de7f5d71", "ja": "今日はプレオープンだから、自由に行動して\n大丈夫だそうだ。たくさん見学して、食べ歩いてくれ！", "zh": "听说今天是试营业，可以自由行动。尽情参观，多逛逛，也一路吃遍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "018ed6f75bde5ebe1e8c363be200cea09709badae311733621b80f9374142c89", "ja": "サーターアンダギーに、ソーキそば……\n沖縄名物のお店が、たくさん並んでるね。", "zh": "萨塔安达吉、冲绳荞麦面……\n卖冲绳特产的店一家挨着一家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "c26a4ca99bb5f3182f0f412c2622259598c8c649a4a7fab0bc4c32724ac94fe1", "ja": "どれも食べてみたいな～。せっかくだから、\nみんなでシェアしていっぱい食べようよ♪", "zh": "每一样都想尝尝看～。难得有机会，\n大家一起分着吃个够吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b3c119351408bf13e87e9fa6528f72c18226003a212332ff3169c15216528cf", "ja": "はいっ、盛り上がっちゃいましょう！　アイドル\nちゃんが楽しんでいる姿は、集客効果抜群ですから！", "zh": "好！让气氛热烈起来吧！偶像们开心享受的样子，可是吸引客人的绝佳招牌呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "7d00b18483b8af44d669f702e8484764aeef9c1873b18f076ab67a08622a81ba", "ja": "それじゃあ、さっそく……ねぇヒビキ！\nワタシ、タコライスが食べたいナ～♪", "zh": "那我们马上就……喂，响！我想吃塔可饭～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "48e0e9ef98fe62765ad962e2d5b599fbedda96e011a68725846640c3a6805776", "ja": "アタシは、食べたことがない沖縄グルメに挑戦して\nみたいな……さっき、角煮みたいなのがあったよね？", "zh": "我想挑战一下没吃过的冲绳美食……\n刚才是不是有种像东坡肉一样的菜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "13fdd709b658d615a3f0dfce3f7668a9670ce6f35e43b7f00d69bf3b20a8a304", "ja": "タコライスと、ラフテーだね！\n自分が案内するから、みんなで行こう！", "zh": "是塔可饭和拉夫特炖肉！我来带路，大家一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d572b2ee2450c19bca29d78b6c336d62648422547d095acb845bdf1e95f8f285", "ja": "（響たちが楽しんでいる姿を、数名のカメラマンさんが\n追いかけるようにして撮影は進み……）", "zh": "（几名摄影师跟拍着响她们开心的样子，拍摄就这样进行着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1027_p", "source_sha256": "94853b5f893ed29e6fc3efb99ab8b4daa8950af7f2408103aa22bb31318d2428", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nいい表情が撮れたって、カメラマンさんも言ってたよ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n摄影师也说拍到了很棒的表情哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "045290c1f6258cc07733ebaea7c3b0fdf72dd1dfc7754a4afcf224788dd635e2", "ja": "自分も、すっごく楽しかった！　これなら\n来てくれる人達にも、絶対楽しんでもらえるよね！", "zh": "我也玩得特别开心！这样一来，来参加的人也一定能玩得开心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "192251d7477376ceb0074f138aef79064bcb60b579bc7c0dc0b9d19ce628f059", "ja": "美味しいものを食べられるお仕事、最高だね！\n沖縄グルメを満喫しちゃったよ……♪", "zh": "能做吃美食的工作，真是太棒了！\n我已经把冲绳美食吃了个遍……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "ff2d9b8507f681dac2ba351691342fc57ac2a7ee82ade9e9217df1ab592f17aa", "ja": "ワタシはお土産に、小さいシーサーを買ったヨ♪\nすっごくカワイイよね、これ♪", "zh": "我买了个小小的风狮爷当伴手礼哦♪  \n这个超级可爱的，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e931bc590bca9aaef6ff87273d6a9da7adf786b603606656c26493463739bb0", "ja": "さすが、響ちゃんの生まれ故郷です！\nありさも大満足のフェアでした♪", "zh": "不愧是响的故乡！亚利沙也对这次活动非常满意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1032_p", "source_sha256": "9cf5823cbb5d5aa1cf88982f16a8b7407ddb210616b13bdad034325b59f34559", "ja": "次は来週の日曜日に、ミニライブと握手会だな。\nその後は劇場の公演を挟んで、連休にミニライブ……。", "zh": "下次是下周日的迷你演唱会和握手会。\n之后穿插剧场公演，连休期间还有迷你演唱会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1033_p", "source_sha256": "79d25c9d7fa17426afbd226b1cfc012eb9c4846555b878ac959f287a1deee867", "ja": "なかなかのハードスケジュールだけど、\n問題ないか？　響。", "zh": "日程相当紧凑，不过没问题吧，响？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "cd572bd5e36a441f81717f6f58836b2c57dcc763a837fdf8661dc9ad39fac91d", "ja": "これくらい、なんくるないさー！\n自分、絶好調だから！　どんどんまかせてよね！", "zh": "这点程度，总会有办法的啦——！\n我现在状态正好！尽管交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
