{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1047_013hib", "source_sha256": "d6c203e8695adbb091e601f7e0c5a49082e8f850f7bec847a01ccc63dfcc945c", "ja": "最後の曲は、みんなも一緒に歌って、\n最高に楽しい気分になってほしいんだ！", "zh": "最后一首歌，希望大家也一起唱，\n一起感受最棒的快乐心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "492f4ae9e20a058cad6d70dc38ca626f34b04e94b964962bc547dae2fabd7a7d", "ja": "この会場を、沖縄のビーチにしちゃうぞ～！\n……『Pon De Beach』！", "zh": "我要把这个会场变成冲绳的海滩哦～！\n……《Pon De Beach》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1050_fun1", "source_sha256": "555103e76dc93ebf295bae0653d02ad313b9fb8dca70f1040e4b17a7ea96657e", "ja": "響ちゃん！　ミニライブ、最高でした！\n沖縄のビーチにいる気分になれました♪", "zh": "响！迷你演唱会太棒了！\n让我感觉自己就像在冲绳的海滩上一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1051_013hib", "source_sha256": "b9575554ace53e7c35e1f6300ef1f39b95ddd4b5376516cd506eb8279b658937", "ja": "えへへ、でしょでしょ？　次の劇場公演でも、\n自分がセンターで歌うから、また見に来てね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吧是吧？下次的剧场公演我也会站在中心唱歌，所以要再来看我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1052_fun1", "source_sha256": "cb4d12d956c8461a5127c37cb6d12dd886fcdffdca7571f8825312d652270d07", "ja": "はい、絶対行きます！", "zh": "是的，我一定会去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1053_013hib", "source_sha256": "354ec70c0ae9a2eae659c316dcb26da16419c8079e7da6ff74e3619e59e68167", "ja": "握手会、参加してくれてありがとね！　ちゃんと\n水分補給するんだぞ！　……最後の人、どうぞ！", "zh": "谢谢你来参加握手会！要好好补充水分哦！……最后一位，请过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1054_fun2", "source_sha256": "5b991ddd89b94b093a3b540d15204385f08d97583e9b6e731213b48dc699b57d", "ja": "こ、こんにちは！　あの……私、ずっと前から\n響ちゃんのファンで。それで……えっと……。", "zh": "你、你好！那个……我从很久以前开始就是\n响的粉丝了。所以……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1055_013hib", "source_sha256": "4e7b6bbd07e8f4e2667b8d67bcb9ef1af887232ba54f43a9c5996788dd9e9d0c", "ja": "ありがとー！　そんなに緊張しなくて大丈夫だからね。\n友達みたいに、気軽に話してくれたらうれしいぞ。", "zh": "谢谢你～！不用那么紧张也没关系的哦。\n要是你能像对朋友一样，轻松地跟我聊天，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1056_fun2", "source_sha256": "ffe61a07518c9a0a021658412b6d242e6e12a779a0ac3de17c3dfe609fed68a6", "ja": "は、はいっ。あの……私も、海の近くの生まれで……\nでも沖縄みたいに、キレイなリゾート地じゃなくて……", "zh": "我、我也是在海边出生的……不过那里并不是像冲绳那样美丽的度假胜地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1057_fun2", "source_sha256": "fd85a9b718dae9ebb289707002b7cbe04f7c1e527dba81130d23d6018d493377", "ja": "海に、いい思い出があんまりなくて。\n地元も海も、ずっと、好きじゃなかったんです……。", "zh": "我对大海没什么美好的回忆。\n一直以来，我都不喜欢家乡，也不喜欢大海……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1058_013hib", "source_sha256": "34897652ac29a62af04f49bff7388e8eb75720096e92f3859128ba47c5e1ce21", "ja": "えっ、そうなんだ……。あ、じゃあ\nもしかして、ライブ楽しめなかった！？", "zh": "诶，是这样啊……啊，那你该不会没能享受演唱会吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1059_fun2", "source_sha256": "5b1e1b4f4c9f90638f74a890bec2b4a3fb94bafe982661905f2f20d61c554c26", "ja": "いえっ、楽しかったです！　むしろ一緒に歌うのが\n楽しくて、気持ちが楽になったっていうか……。", "zh": "不是的，我很开心！倒不如说，一起唱歌让我觉得很开心，心情也轻松了不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1060_fun2", "source_sha256": "e2dffcc2a045294b8d14e21349aa8403e5d98deeb281dd84eb9ce35e8dfe626f", "ja": "もしかしたら、海を好きになれるかもしれないって……\nあの、だから、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "说不定，我会喜欢上海也说不定……\n\n那个，所以，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1061_013hib", "source_sha256": "4dc154230731b9f1f99ca947748e61f166e5efde61ac08d208a9cb6c37f80356", "ja": "よかった……ねえ、\nまた自分の歌、聞きにきてくれる！？", "zh": "太好了……那个，\n你还会再来听我唱歌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1062_fun2", "source_sha256": "134b50899bedf51b2f0acc0d214d8199fa33a1ba8403909a5cd6c99713a4f9fa", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんです！　あの、変な話しちゃって\nごめんなさい！　響ちゃん、応援してます！", "zh": "好的，当然可以！那个，抱歉跟你说了些奇怪的话！\n响，我会为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1063_013hib", "source_sha256": "4647511f759171da09ea629416224b84e4c02458ef343db8507628f189ea3075", "ja": "地元も海も、好きじゃない……。\nそっか。そういうことも、あるんだ……。", "zh": "老家和大海，都不喜欢……。\n这样啊。原来也是会有这种情况的啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1064_p", "source_sha256": "48223bd1217ac8e19adcaee421d2d8fc0b4b5d728521ec80514f61226c52d637", "ja": "よし、今の人で終わりだな。\n……響？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "好，刚才那位就是最后一个了。\n……响？你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1065_013hib", "source_sha256": "48407662ee3b9f1f02761fdd4ac9478e67780a3123278b5ef9daf369e46cff35", "ja": "{$P$}……うん。\nえっと……。", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1066_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5458b5bc4118a0d1133833db27e6216a81682dfd878eaea6f2f5bac08469540e", "ja": "そんなことがあったんだ……。", "zh": "原来发生过那样的事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1067_013hib", "source_sha256": "5a04bd0186b55865339f7deeb7897561843420c3420c131f488a505a2d6e318e", "ja": "自分、『Pon De Beach』を聞いて、\nみんなに元気になってもらいたかったんだけど……。", "zh": "我本来想放首《Pon De Beach》，让大家打起精神来的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1068_013hib", "source_sha256": "c0b4880447d7dceff452db9d6b83158d1ff29ec88976ef27b5f19084ad6f1b70", "ja": "海が好きじゃない子がいるなんて、\nちっとも思わなかったから……。", "zh": "我完全没想到，会有不喜欢大海的孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1069_043nor", "source_sha256": "a1ec23034b69262b8503d9e6b6d1fb07106d8b5815dd138a691e664eb0b81656", "ja": "難しい問題だね……。", "zh": "真是个难题啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1070_013hib", "source_sha256": "70bdc1a4b8c138ee6b9fa1c61deee49c7e5eeac4a14b7fd0df9d9585fbe035aa", "ja": "それで、改めて考えてみて……気が付いたんだ。\n思い出って、人によって全然違うんだってこと。", "zh": "于是，我重新思考了一下……终于意识到了。\n回忆这种东西，对每个人来说都完全不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1071_013hib", "source_sha256": "4b61e4f3b309f94a1b76f3131baa60fb4de1e6490296adae973e31acdd25c6a3", "ja": "自分にとって元気の出るものが、\n反対になっちゃう人もいるかもしれないんだね。", "zh": "对我来说能让人打起精神的东西，也可能会让另一些人反而没精神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1072_013hib", "source_sha256": "bda4d10e79e163cb55f8b4c8ada6cff9601bb8db4f9de4dee5d253ce54749f16", "ja": "だから『Pon De Beach』を聞いた人全員に\n元気になってもらうのは、難しいのかもって。", "zh": "所以，想让所有听到《Pon De Beach》的人都打起精神来，可能有点难吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1073_018ele", "source_sha256": "61ccc0d75e90aa3c9294c69d299e963d33495f16e73d0a1555c1c7089c7f6a8f", "ja": "そっか……。ヒビキは優しいから、\nファンの人の気持ちを考えちゃったんだネ……。", "zh": "这样啊……响很温柔，所以会不由得替粉丝们着想呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1074_p", "source_sha256": "08fbdfd5bc39a7cf7e53dbebb673330b8b4b2be2765c29613a3b003e5631dbc5", "ja": "響が、自分と違うたくさんの人の存在に気づけたのは、\nいい事だと俺は思うよ。でも……。", "zh": "我觉得，响能够意识到有很多和自己不同的人存在，是件好事。但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1075_p", "source_sha256": "cd1ed4e7b4fac5fe201b7673bcbc03f17ed029c9b2de2244a9d171c0f49c6649", "ja": "たとえ難しくても、「たくさんの人に楽しんでほしい」\nと思う事を、悪い事だと思っては欲しくないんだ。", "zh": "即使很困难，也不要觉得“希望很多人都能享受其中”是不好的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1076_028ari", "source_sha256": "822b60869d3ba0a27d1ebef3cdb0f0427ca91d568edfa008cc5594f0a1b35440", "ja": "そうですよ！　それに、そのファンの子は、\n気持ちが変わったって言ったんですよね？", "zh": "没错！而且，那位粉丝不是说自己改变想法了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1077_028ari", "source_sha256": "9b03b574c75d34d09eb69be2434b3c2dc80478f63854c20043d9657c8a46e84d", "ja": "アイドルちゃんのファンが、交流会でアイドルちゃんを\n困らせるようなことだけ言うなんて、考えられません！", "zh": "我无法相信偶像的粉丝会在交流会上只说些让偶像为难的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1078_013hib", "source_sha256": "ed9aa2aa36afc1a7e22d968836773c3bd2576513c015092fd58f3d753f076da6", "ja": "あ、それは……うん。えっと、気持ちが楽になって……\n海が、好きになれるかもしれないって言ってた。", "zh": "啊，那个……嗯。她说，心情变得轻松了……说不定会喜欢上海洋了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1079_004yuk", "source_sha256": "19b8a615a8d1c2ef8b100cd9a6a4adf752d3f1d259deb8ccb4a58531ecc6ce0d", "ja": "響ちゃん。それって、すごいことなんじゃないかな？\n歌の力で、そんなふうに思ってもらえるなんて……。", "zh": "响，这不是很了不起吗？居然能让人因为歌声的力量产生那样的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1080_013hib", "source_sha256": "58eb1f273fd9224938f1ba9c15eaefcc91bd5a4eecbc3268371a8c6fd4e2dbfd", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうかな……？", "zh": "咦！？是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1081_043nor", "source_sha256": "8b9df336a968c531560e98eef100e845a826e9cef006a4d3475fc6100fbe460c", "ja": "そうだよ！　だって響の歌を聞いて、\n海がイヤじゃなくなるかも、って思ったんでしょ？", "zh": "就是啊！因为你听了响的歌，觉得说不定就不会再讨厌大海了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1082_p", "source_sha256": "b0c1c9397455562bf3099c6ea76f2b875bca747e77732f00746404f650ba1a62", "ja": "俺もそう思うよ、響。\n歌には力があって、響はそれを届ける事ができた……。", "zh": "我也这么认为，响。歌声拥有力量，而响你把这份力量传达出去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1083_p", "source_sha256": "0cccb0da4062e4d69a66c539f59661c6ae2e285b4b6dfda66d368cd5b99dfb9a", "ja": "響の歌に力をもらう人は、他にもきっといると思う。\nならあとは、響の気持ち次第じゃないかな？", "zh": "我想，一定还有其他人能从响的歌声中获得力量。既然如此，接下来就看响自己的心情了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1084_013hib", "source_sha256": "01925fd72e7389edc7b1a1eb2390d896fe2b2b5bad2d855b558bd40d1353c808", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nみんな……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1085_013hib", "source_sha256": "e6c6dca792d70713ed11c568ec60170ed87a0a66fc1c0cbdf9cd529978bd8efd", "ja": "うん……そうだよね。自分はやっぱり、\n大好きなこの曲で、みんなを元気にしたい……。", "zh": "嗯……就是这样。我果然还是想用这首最喜欢的歌，为大家打起精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1086_013hib", "source_sha256": "d7ee1912943bcd13552f57cd2ea2dd22850ec87af706eba1c3ab7c689c1ca6cd", "ja": "よし！\n自分、みんなに宣言しておくぞ！", "zh": "好！\n我这就向大家宣言！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1087_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99ba9ddc265ed0729b49551072775cd2b6eb487a8e36ec22a4a6320ded87b22c", "ja": "宣言？", "zh": "宣言？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1088_013hib", "source_sha256": "153bd033920b3ae9f8d5635b7b195e83ba333fb476e6d9a1333ab202661a1cdf", "ja": "うん！　『Pon De Beach』を、この\nライブに来てくれた人みんなの思い出の曲にする！", "zh": "嗯！要把《Pon De Beach》变成所有来到这场演唱会的人共同的回忆之歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1089_013hib", "source_sha256": "5c7d95f1c1cae0ad74a967dffaabaa9ac85a72470fc7935ff9903bd1df82d154", "ja": "聞く度に、このライブのことを思い出して、\n元気になれる……そんな歌にするさー！", "zh": "每次听到这首歌，都会想起这场演唱会，然后重新打起精神……要把它变成这样一首歌啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1090_028ari", "source_sha256": "e084b9b4b00f3bc997a9249db2c14930042441c52077f95da72134e4f315eecc", "ja": "響ちゃん……さすがですーっ！\nその崇高な志、実に、実に素晴らしいですーっ！", "zh": "响，真不愧是你——！这崇高的志向，实在是太、太棒了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1091_018ele", "source_sha256": "3ae38d378a7c0b4ac88f50d0876ebd1d6583ddefdd9da19de3ce4a22f638a242", "ja": "ワタシも、ヒビキの歌が大好き！　ヒビキも、\nヒビキが感じさせてくれるこの曲も、大好きだヨ♪", "zh": "我也最喜欢响的歌了！响，还有响让我感受到的这首歌，我都最喜欢啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1092_013hib", "source_sha256": "31f04d706bc1193f2771669dc6abf2d60d8630de0044077d893ea1ac11ac0740", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう！", "zh": "各位，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1093_013hib", "source_sha256": "a93d2488f64f58f9fed2b104c60fd6ffcdaab794408e50fdaa4a05e81046a9f7", "ja": "……うん。自分の目標は、やっぱり変わらない。\n来てくれたみんなに、楽しんでもらうこと！", "zh": "……嗯。自己的目标，果然还是不会变。\n就是要让前来的大家，都能乐在其中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1094_013hib", "source_sha256": "2a347e946fd0af96da0189aa631cf007f77f5fba0e0cb98784f9553d0f28b93a", "ja": "もう自分、迷わないから！　だから\n次の公演、しっかり自分についてきてよね！", "zh": "我已经不会再迷茫了！所以，下次公演时要好好跟上我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1095_p", "source_sha256": "1eb5d123505e07018f77d408b6044721ce788d94f85ed561f8716723d0ac4ba1", "ja": "（その後、響はますますレッスンに熱を入れ……\nついに、劇場での公演日を迎えた！）", "zh": "（之后，响更加投入地进行训练……终于迎来了在剧场公演的日子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1096_013hib", "source_sha256": "0631bead1e1d3d35a64dee9bce018404904f8e436e3d250b6cedb2fb281f6ebb", "ja": "{$P$}！　あのね、自分、今……\nすっごくワクワクしてるんだ！", "zh": "{$P$}！那个啊，我现在……\n真的特别特别期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1097_013hib", "source_sha256": "af77fc9e50513a646c7570df82130dde84cba64e5441f1ce2d538b182ad218eb", "ja": "今日の公演で、『Pon De Beach』を\nもっともっと大きなスケールの曲にしてみせるからね！", "zh": "我会在今天的公演上，把《Pon De Beach》变成规模更大更大的歌曲给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1098_p", "source_sha256": "a35658aa8b66923227877d5774979517d5a0dffe4a6cc8396b37a0c9d47739f8", "ja": "ああ、楽しみにしてるよ。\nここで、しっかり見てるからな……！", "zh": "啊，我很期待。\n我会在这里好好看着你的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_091_1099_p", "source_sha256": "aa8d1f1091a2f3238abc76dcc2e7ef85bbdbf72b7dc3511651a15bd75439f294", "ja": "（今の響ならきっと、誰もがまぶしいと感じる\n最高のビーチに連れていってくれるだろう……！）", "zh": "（现在的响，一定能带我们去最棒的海滩，让所有人都觉得耀眼吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
